{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ng8agc","slideIndex":0,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: game art direction presentation, cinematic environment concept. Create a landscape 16:9 detailed painterly 3D-style fantasy FPS concept image of a stopped clockwork royal citadel: enormous medieval stone arches and Gothic towers built around a giant dormant brass clock heart, exposed copper pipes, huge counterweights, maintenance walkways, reachable raised platforms and ramps, an abandoned armory corridor opens into the mechanical hall. One small slender armored clockwork sentinel for scale, carrying a rivet carbine. Grey blue basalt #343D49, weathered brass #A67C45, small cyan energy #54C7CC, restrained warm amber rewards. Clear readable architectural shapes suited to modular game modeling, stylized physically based surfaces, haunting stillness, moderate brighter bounce light so forms are visible. Wide three-quarter view at human eye level. No words, labels, logos, HUD, watermark. This is concept inspiration, not an actual screenshot.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：旗帜、仪表、小型蒸汽特效。先用静态配重表现停摆。"}
